    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a7">

                <pb facs="0567" n="517" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg517"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 7.—To the legation of Portugal at
                        Riode Janeiro.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-15"><hi rendition="#small-caps">March</hi> 15,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>As to the refugees, we should act exactly like the other nations which have there
                    important interests and ships of war in which the vanquished revolutionists may
                    have been gathered.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hintze Ribeiro.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
